REGENT OF SUKOHARJO
REGIONAL REGULATION OF SUKOHARJO REGENCY
NUMBER 6 YEAR 2011
CONCERNING
THE IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR VICTIMS OF
GENDER-BASED VIOLENCE AND CHILDREN
BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY
THE REGENT OF SUKOHARJO,

Considering : a. that all forms of violence, especially gender-based violence and violence against children are violations of human rights and crimes against human dignity as well as forms of discrimination;
b. that victims of gender-based violence and children must receive protection, both from the regional government and/or the community in order to be protected and free from violence and/or threats of violence within the scope of the household and community;
c. that based on Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection and Law Number 23 Year 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence, the Regional Government together with the community is obligated to undertake prevention, protection, and recovery efforts for victims of gender-based violence and children;
d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Implementation of Protection for Victims of Gender-Based Violence and Children;

